=2 Walkthrough
!Updated marked map yorcia weald.jpeg|right|Map of Yorcia Weald.
* Obtain a {@k} {k:Yorcia's tear} via one of two methods:
** **Option 1:** Click on the **Ergon Locus ???** at the southern part of (I-8) in {z:Yorcia Weald}.
*** You must enter (I-8) from the West, but there is occasionally a wall that blocks the path. **The path opens at 21:00.**
*** To find the correct **Ergon Locus ???**: Stand on the **Suspicious Place** and turn your camera until your compass points North-East. The **Ergon Locus ???** will be directly in front of you.
*** There is also another **Ergon Locus** and a **???** in the northern part of (I-8), but neither of those are the correct location. You need to use the one mentioned above entering (I-8) from the west.
** **Option 2:** Harvest by using a {i:Sickle|Sickle|1020} on a **Harvesting Point**.
*** Bring extra {i:Sickles|Sickle|1020} as they may break before obtaining the {p:key item|Key items}. Harvesting with a full inventory will prevent you from receiving normal items; however, **Harvesting Points** will still be used while attempting for the {p:key item|Key items}.
*** **Harvesting Points** can be scarce, and will despawn and respawn elsewhere after a set amount of time. Option 1 is much easier.
* Go to (G-6) after obtaining your {@k} {k:Yorcia's tear} and click the **Pellucid Afflusion** next to the pond for a cutscene.
** There is a bush at the corner of (G-5/6)-(H-5/6) that moves up and down blocking the path at times. It seems to move up and down every 5 to 10 minutes.
*** This was back when colonization levels were a lot lower, while hovering around 80% they don't pop up often.
* After the cutscene, you will obtain the {@k} {k:Rosulatia's pome}.

=2 Notes
The **Ergon Locus ???** was added after this Mission was implemented due to complaints on how difficult it was to obtain the key item from harvesting.
